    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949793600000
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949798133333
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Could you please provide your order number?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949800133333
    },
    {
      "text": "VF0987-654321.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949805866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. I see you're calling about the AeroFlow helmet, delivered 35 days ago. To proceed, can you tell me what specifically is the issue with it? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949806999999
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is wrong.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949820399999
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. So it's just a preference for a different color, correct? There's no issue with the helmet's fit or any of its safety features?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949821866665
    },
    {
      "text": "It's fine. It's just not the color I wanted.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949831466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, and just to confirm, is the box unopened?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949834599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it is. I saw the color and didn't bother.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949837933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for clarifying. Let me just check the policy for that item. One moment... Okay, I've confirmed it. Since you received the helmet 35 days ago, you're still well within our 90-day return window for standard items. I can go ahead and approve this return for you immediately.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949841199997
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. Just send me the label.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 18808,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1764949860733330
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. I've just sent the prepaid return label to the email on file. You can simply print it out, attach it to the package, and drop it off at any post office. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
